        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"logica-computacional-multiplicacao-de-inteiros\">L\u00f3gica Computacional \u2014 Multiplica\u00e7\u00e3o de Inteiros</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Resolu\u00e7\u00e3o organizada segundo a ficha <strong>Verifica\u00e7\u00e3o Indutiva</strong>.\nO modelo usa <code>BitVec</code> de 8 bits e o solver Z3.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Estados do programa:</strong> <code>INIT</code>, <code>TEST</code>, <code>END</code> e <code>ERROR</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
