            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"alinea-a-construcao-do-sfots\">Al\u00ednea a \u2014 Constru\u00e7\u00e3o do SFOTS</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Cada estado cont\u00e9m o contador de programa (<code>pc</code>), os valores de entrada\n(<code>a</code>, <code>b</code>) e as vari\u00e1veis de trabalho (<code>x</code>, <code>y</code>, <code>z</code>).</span></span>"
